1679	     * Process a broker heartbeat which has been sitting on the queue for too long, and has
1680	     * expired. With default settings, this would happen after 1 second. We process expired
1681	     * heartbeats by updating the lastSeenNs of the broker, so that the broker won't get fenced
1682	     * incorrectly. However, we don't perform any state changes that we normally would, such as
1683	     * unfencing a fenced broker, etc.
1684	     */
